text = "This is a message from the Gnomes.

We desperately need your help. We have been isolated from our brothers and trapped by the dark lord Gilgamesh.

Together we are strong, but we are powerless on our own.

We have been scattered across the universe. Please, rescue us. With your help we may be able to defeat Gilgamesh once and for all.

You are the chosen one. Only you can hear our plea. 

You are the Gnome Savior."
